      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahit humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida, ea haleanjeadaanyi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama muchu eaweeteaba ispwa ea niihiit ASEETA gadiyeadaanyi heeta sin, ak gafuuf eaweeteaba ispwa aba gadiyoojigaaschi sean heeta sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoamiidu ASEETA eaweeteaba ispwa ak ghoaghaydiit, aba gideaba eaweecheanji gafuuf ASEETA aba gadiyoojigaaschi sean nisin damanda bwada ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Boostaaneeda Edeeni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gida sibwata humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba eaweeda sina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ng'eanyiida ea humng'eeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda ea manda geeta dareabeeta nirdu aba jeeda ng'eanyiida ak ea manda seenga dareabeeta nirdu aba gideaba mii ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA gwaroobassa ng'eanyiida roopta, ak ea manda siida jea ghabwar ng'eanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadu gwadiyeadawa dung'usta badayda ng'eanyiida ak gwaroobassa badayda ng'eanyiisean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gwasin NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA siida aba sigeeda ng'eanyiida, ak gaguusa sareenuuka jeameeda eadu eaweega; ak ghwanyas siida eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwahista NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA boostaani aba Edeeni mida heeda ghayeawa; ak ghwayiin siidida heeta siniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu aba badayda ng'eanyiida gooruudu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA giliwas geeta miy aba gheang'da ak aamiy aba agita, ea geeta eaweega earada ghwayiin bugusta boostaani, ea geeta sinala gidamiy ea gidamuy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguldeawa eenda Edeeni ak gagulsa boostaani, ak gabearshi ak ghoah eeni ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheawunga dea madeeda geeguura Bishoni; nea eenda gulda nea gwaneaweesa ng'eanyiisean bea Hafila, mida dahaabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea dahaabu bea ng'eanyiita aamiyaas; lagheanga ng'ooreadi ea lagheanga haw sheayeat gwanda sean hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheawunga ghealoodeaba iyeenya geeguura Gihoni; gulda nea gwaneaweesa ng'eanyiisean bea Gushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheawunga ghealoodeaba samwagu geeguura Hidekeli, ak iissa gagulda nea gwasik gayeewda Ashuru. Ak ghealoodeaba ang'wan geeguura Furati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA siidida ak ghwayiin jeeda boostaaneeda Edeeni ak ghabwar nea gwasisin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA siida, “Giimuusi aga giliwas geat aba jeeda madamnyeanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadu geeta sinala gidamiy ea gidamuy adiidu giyaagi, aba gideaba eaweeda iyaagi gaymeawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, “Mii miy gideaba gaygwandeawa siida geaw; gaydasissa niny siida jea gaweechi uurji niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA giliwas diyeayda jarooda ea giliwas dariideanda humng'eeda, amang'ata gweadu heeda siida gang'asa gheawunga; ak gheawunga ng'assa siida gilinyoo ea diyeayda mideawa eaweega gil, ghoah gheawungaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gang'asa siida dugwa sean gheawunga, ea dariidaka humng'eeda, ea giliwas diyeayda dareabeeta; nea siida ea mwanyasa dea jea ghaweat niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA goobissa siida ruweanga ng'weani, amadu nea gwalil gageanda gisheajeandaanyi agi ak gwadukuteawa seawadeedida banyeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gisheajeandida geana NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEAN heeda siidean gwasin ghoah gatmooda ak gweadu heeda siida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang'ata gwayi siida,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
